    <h2 style="color:var(--primary);margin-top:48px">VELYS Robotic Knee Replacement</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.75;max-width:820px">DHS performs knee replacement with the VELYS robotic-assisted solution. Instead of a pre-operative CT scan, VELYS maps your knee during surgery and guides each bone cut to a plan built for your joint. Most patients stand and walk with support on the day of surgery, go home in 2&ndash;3 days and return to daily activities, including driving, in 4&ndash;6 weeks. Individual recovery varies. <a href="/velys-robotic-knee-replacement-ahmedabad/">Read the full VELYS guide</a> or see <a href="/knee-replacement-ahmedabad/">knee replacement options at DHS</a>.</p>

