    <h2 style="color:var(--primary);margin-top:48px">Insurance &amp; Cashless Care</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.75;max-width:820px">Orthopedic procedures at DHS, including joint replacement and trauma surgery, are covered by most Indian health insurance policies and TPAs. DHS is empaneled with major insurers and processes cashless claims through its insurance desk, which can confirm your policy's coverage before admission. <a href="/cashless/">See cashless &amp; insurance details</a>.</p>

