        {q: "Where Can I Get Orthopedic Surgery in Ahmedabad?", a: "You can get orthopedic surgery &mdash; including knee and hip replacement, fracture fixation, spine surgery and arthroscopic procedures &mdash; at DHS Multispecialty Hospital in Ahmedabad. The hospital has a dedicated orthopedic operation theatre, VELYS robotic-assisted technology for joint replacement, and an in-house orthopedic surgical team led by Dr. Hardik Shah and Dr. Swagat Shah."},
        {q: "Is There an Orthopedic Doctor Near Me in Ahmedabad?", a: "DHS Multispecialty Hospital's orthopedic doctors, Dr. Hardik M Shah and Dr. Swagat M Shah, see patients daily at the hospital in Ahmedabad for joint pain, fractures, sports injuries, spine conditions and pediatric orthopedic concerns. You can book a consultation online or call the hospital directly to check same-day availability."},
        {q: "What orthopedic sub-specialties does DHS treat?", a: "DHS treats joint replacement (knee &amp; hip), trauma &amp; fracture care, spine conditions, sports injuries via arthroscopy, and pediatric orthopedic conditions &mdash; all managed by the same orthopedic team on one campus."},
        {q: "Does DHS offer robotic knee replacement?", a: "Yes. DHS offers VELYS robotic-assisted, imageless knee replacement, which uses real-time intra-operative digital mapping instead of a pre-operative CT scan, performed by Dr. Hardik Shah and Dr. Swagat Shah."},
        {q: "Is cashless insurance available for orthopedic surgery at DHS?", a: "Yes. DHS Multispecialty Hospital processes cashless insurance claims for orthopedic procedures including joint replacement and trauma surgery. Our insurance desk can confirm your specific policy's coverage before admission."},
        {q: "What is VELYS robotic knee replacement?", a: "VELYS is an imageless, robotic-assisted knee replacement system. It maps the knee during surgery instead of using a pre-operative CT scan, and guides bone cuts and implant placement to a plan built for each patient's joint. DHS performs VELYS knee replacement in Ahmedabad."},
        {q: "How do I book an appointment with Dr. Hardik Shah?", a: "Book online on the DHS appointment page, call +91 9081610444, or message DHS on WhatsApp. Dr. Hardik M Shah sees orthopedic patients at DHS Multispecialty Hospital, Gurukul, Ahmedabad."},
        {q: "What is the recovery time after robotic knee replacement?", a: "Most patients stand and walk with support on the day of surgery, are discharged in 2 to 3 days, walk without aids in 1 to 2 weeks, return to daily activities including driving in 4 to 6 weeks, and reach full recovery in 3 to 4 months. Individual recovery varies with age, bone quality and physiotherapy."}
